# textlookup-en-us.expected: full dump of frontend/data/locale/en-US.ini
# (1 of the 77 locale files) through the C text_lookup (S-010 §5.7,
# P1-08.4 "Done when: loads en-US.ini and gets identical values").
# Provenance: C reference obsproject/obs-studio 33.0.1, 64-bit Linux, -O2.
# Generator: test/conformance/gen/textlookup_dump.c (one line per key:
#   "kv <key> <value>").
# The Rust test (obs-util text_lookup) loads the same file through its
# port with the same key extraction and compares every line. Gated:
# skipped (one printed line) when the libobs checkout link is absent.
