kv QuickTransitions.SwapScenes Swap Preview/Program Scenes After Transitioning
kv QuickTransitions.SwapScenesTT Swaps the preview and program scenes after transitioning (if the program's original scene still exists).
This will not undo any changes that may have been made to the program's original scene.
kv QuickTransitions.DuplicateScene Duplicate Scene
kv QuickTransitions.DuplicateSceneTT When editing the same scene, allows editing transform/visibility of sources without modifying the program output.
To edit properties of sources without modifying the program output, enable 'Duplicate Sources'.
Changing this value will reset the current program scene (if it still exists).
kv QuickTransitions.EditProperties Duplicate Sources
kv QuickTransitions.EditPropertiesTT When editing the same scene, allows editing properties of sources without modifying the program output.
This can only be used if 'Duplicate Scene' is enabled.
Certain sources (such as capture or media sources) do not support this and cannot be edited separately.
Changing this value will reset the current program scene (if it still exists).

Warning: Because sources will be duplicated, this may require extra system or video resources.
