kv Basic.Settings.Output Output
kv Basic.Settings.Output.Format Recording Format
kv Basic.Settings.Output.Format.MKV Matroska Video (.mkv)
kv Basic.Settings.Output.Format.FLV Flash Video (.flv)
kv Basic.Settings.Output.Format.MP4 MPEG-4 (.mp4)
kv Basic.Settings.Output.Format.MOV QuickTime (.mov)
kv Basic.Settings.Output.Format.TS MPEG-TS (.ts)
kv Basic.Settings.Output.Format.HLS HLS (.m3u8 + .ts)
kv Basic.Settings.Output.Format.hMP4 Hybrid MP4 (.mp4)
kv Basic.Settings.Output.Format.hMOV Hybrid MOV (.mov)
kv Basic.Settings.Output.Format.fMP4 Fragmented MP4 (.mp4)
kv Basic.Settings.Output.Format.fMOV Fragmented MOV (.mov)
kv Basic.Settings.Output.Format.TT.fragmented_mov Fragmented MOV writes the recording in chunks and does not require the same finalization as traditional MOV files.
This ensures the file remains playable even if writing to disk is interrupted, for example, as a result of a BSOD or power loss.

This may not be compatible with all players and editors. Use File → Remux Recordings to convert the file into a more compatible format if necessary.
kv Basic.Settings.Output.Format.TT.fragmented_mp4 Fragmented MP4 writes the recording in chunks and does not require the same finalization as traditional MP4 files.
This ensures the file remains playable even if writing to disk is interrupted, for example, as a result of a BSOD or power loss.

This may not be compatible with all players and editors. Use File → Remux Recordings to convert the file into a more compatible format if necessary.
kv Basic.Settings.Output.Encoder.Video Video Encoder
kv Basic.Settings.Output.Encoder.Audio Audio Encoder
kv Basic.Settings.Output.SelectDirectory Select Recording Directory
kv Basic.Settings.Output.DynamicBitrate Dynamically change bitrate to manage congestion
kv Basic.Settings.Output.DynamicBitrate.Beta Dynamically change bitrate to manage congestion (Beta)
kv Basic.Settings.Output.DynamicBitrate.TT Instead of dropping frames to reduce congestion, dynamically changes bitrate on the fly.

Note that this can increase delay to viewers if there is significant sudden congestion.
When the bitrate drops, it can take up to a few minutes to restore.

Currently only supported for RTMP.
kv Basic.Settings.Output.Mode Output Mode
